      <p begin="00:04.790" end="00:06.550" ttm:agent="v1">Damn</p>
      <p begin="00:06.550" end="00:08.050" ttm:agent="v1">All of us</p>
      <p begin="00:07.540" end="00:09.910" ttm:agent="v1">Give me a run for my money</p>
      <p begin="00:09.910" end="00:14.230" ttm:agent="v1">There is nobody, no one to outrun me</p>
      <p begin="00:14.230" end="00:17.460" ttm:agent="v1">So give me a run for my money</p>
      <p begin="00:17.460" end="00:23.650" ttm:agent="v1">Sipping bubbly, feeling lovely, living lovely</p>
      <p begin="00:23.650" end="00:27.450" ttm:agent="v1">Just love me</p>
      <p begin="00:27.450" end="00:31.200" ttm:agent="v1">I wanna be with you, ayy, I wanna be with</p>
